WEBVTT

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:05.810
They finally resort to forbidden magic?

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:09.280
The Roland spy.

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:11.650
Perhaps you could ask that woman about it.

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:19.900
<i>Ryner... Please... Your promise...</i>

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:24.000
<i>I've decided not to run away any longer.</i>

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.290
Huh?

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:33.890
Maybe he's not in yet?

00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:37.910
That's ridiculous! It's already well into the day!

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:40.900
There's no way he wouldn't be on the job!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:44.830
For that matter, it wouldn't be surprising for him to pull an all-nighter!

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:46.530
Indeed. When you put it that way...

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:51.460
Hey! Sion, I know you're in there! Sion!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.040
Hey, Sion!

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.780
What the hell?

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:01.690
Goodness gracious.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:05.280
You took long enough getting back. I grew tired of waiting.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:06.750
Hey, what is all of this?

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:11.870
Thanks to a certain someone's absence, a ton of work has accumulated.

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:12.470
Wait, don't tell me...

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:16.640
Until this mountain of documents is properly handled, no sleep for you.

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:20.490
Oh, and don't worry. I also have some work prepared for Ferris.

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:24.990
This... isn't...

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:26.150
...funny!

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:31.370
I agree! This is going to seriously cut in on my dumpling-eating time.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:33.200
You think I could do this crap?

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.400
It won't open.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:39.520
Its key is custom-made.

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:43.210
Now then, I'd like you to get right to work.

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:44.390
Ferris?

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:45.180
Yes.

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:50.840
Oh, no!

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:54.600
I handed my sword to the guards!

00:04:55.070 --> 00:04:58.050
You tyrant! Dictator! Devil!

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.020
I'm glad.

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:05.030
Truly glad... that both of you came back.

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:09.280
Welcome back, Ryner.

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:14.200
More importantly...

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:20.070
Hurry up and open the door. I have a mission I must fulfill!

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:21.090
A mission?

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.650
I'm going to ascertain

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:25.710
that the taste of the dumplings in Roland's domestic dumpling shops hasn't changed.

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:27.510
That's just a food tour!

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:28.920
How could you say that?!

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:32.510
It's an important mission entrusted to me by the God of Dumplings himself!

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:34.870
<i>Ryner...</i>

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:39.620
<i>You've really come back for good, haven't you?</i>

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:42.480
Sion?

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:45.980
What's wrong? Are you feeling ill?

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.570
No, it's nothing.

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.210
That voice...

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:01.330
Ryner?

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.610
Ryner, is that you?

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:08.210
Hold on, I'm coming for you now!

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:15.220
You're...

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:18.520
Lord Sion Astal?

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:23.060
I just want to die.

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:30.990
The spell Froaude placed on her has been removed.

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:33.710
She should wake up shortly.

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:34.990
Then I'll go see Kaiwel...

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:37.430
No, I've already reported it.

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:41.460
He seems concerned about the Ryner Lute matter as well.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:43.990
Ah, Captain Milk is awake!

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:47.100
Idiot, the Captain is still recovering!

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:48.460
Don't yell out so loudly!

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:52.150
Moe... Lach. Where am I?

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:53.660
Are you all right, Captain?!

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:56.220
Lach, use your indoor voice.

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.000
But, come on...

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:02.080
You've slept in quite late, Princess.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.190
Luke...

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:06.000
I...

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:13.150
That man! Why did he come after me?

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:14.740
There's no need to worry.

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:18.140
It's over now.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.840
More importantly, are you hungry?

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:27.280
I'll make whatever you like today, Captain.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.980
Okay! I'll have some curry!

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:31.570
He said whatever the Captain likes!

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:34.090
The Captain's still recovering...

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:35.610
Then how about some porridge?

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:38.040
It's a special occasion, so let's make it into a porridge party!

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:38.970
What's so special about it?

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:43.260
We could hold the Captain's birthday party. Right, Sir Luke?

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:44.560
I can't argue with that.

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:46.560
All right!

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:52.940
<i>They're all hiding something from me.</i>

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:56.720
<i>The spell Froaude placed on her has been removed.</i>

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:58.370
<i>She should wake up shortly.</i>

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.590
<i>Then I'll go see Kaiwel...</i>

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:06.490
<i>Kaiwel? That's Major General Calne Kaiwel.</i>

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:10.870
<i>Major General Kaiwel works closely with Lord Astal.</i>

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:13.930
<i>Why would such a person's name come up?</i>

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:20.510
<i>Is there some connection between my abduction and Lord Astal?</i>

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:25.470
<i>It doesn't seem like Luke and the others would tell me even if I asked, though.</i>

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:28.100
<i>Who else would know about this?</i>

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:31.980
<i>Father!</i>

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:36.150
House Callaud is nobility, so maybe they know something about His Majesty!

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:51.670
Ow!

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:53.590
Forgive me!

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:57.330
It hurts! Stop! Stop!

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:58.470
Ow!

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:00.810
Help me!

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:23.580
I-It can't be...

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:29.020
Father! Mother!

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:45.900
The Duke and Duchess Callaud have both passed away.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:49.560
As you've surmised, they were killed.

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:50.770
Why?!

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:55.110
You're such a kind person, Captain.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:10:02.610
In this country, nobles buy up orphaned children and raise them to be soldiers.

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:04.860
They send them into battle in place of their real children,

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:08.120
to elevate their own status. For nothing more than that.

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:16.380
You would grieve over the death of such parents?

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:20.830
But... Even still...

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:25.140
They raised me for this long.

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:29.350
You are truly...

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:34.880
Luke, you knew and kept quiet, didn't you?

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:38.360
To avoid hurting me...

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:41.810
But... tell me the truth.

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:47.030
What is going on right now in this country?!

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:59.110
Crimson Fingered Claugh, sporting a black arm? Pathetic, huh?

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:02.210
Are you really leaving the hospital?

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:06.110
I'd like to get accustomed to having a new arm.

00:11:06.110 --> 00:11:09.360
I can't do any decent training here.

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:15.440
The doctor said that you should get a little more rest first.

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:18.410
Bah, don't worry about me.

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:19.360
Besides...

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:23.190
...I can't sit around taking it easy forever.

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:27.860
You're going into war again, aren't you?

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.400
It won't be immediately.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:34.570
I'm a soldier. I'll be making preparations to fight.

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:36.080
That's all it is.

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.020
It's cold, isn't it?

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:47.630
No, it's warm.

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:53.200
It's your arm, just as it was when we met.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:17.790
I was right not to bring Eslina along!

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:20.750
It's too hot for children in here!

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:23.730
Fool! What are you talking about?!

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:27.110
Then, I shall be off first.

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:29.890
See ya.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:34.090
She's wasted on you!

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:36.940
Shut up!

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:39.360
So, any signs of movement since then?

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:43.180
The details of the murder of the Duke and Duchess Callaud

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:45.450
remain as yet unclear.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.200
Right now, in Roland,

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:50.410
nobles who voice objections to Sion's way of doing things

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:53.280
are being purged, one after another.

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:56.420
The Duke was an earnest military man.

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:59.280
He would never have acted just in his own self-interests.

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:02.630
Even people like that are being killed relentlessly.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:03.750
Silencing them, huh?

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:06.560
Yes. They must have learned things

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:09.750
they were never meant to know, concerning something.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.520
Is it Froaude's doing?

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:16.530
Actually, it doesn't seem as though Froaude is involved in this matter.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:20.440
He's been doing his own snooping into things.

00:13:22.310 --> 00:13:23.480
What does this mean?

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:27.520
Something's on the move. Who in this country could it be?

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:39.010
Damn that Ferris.

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:44.500
My strength has run out. I'll be back after I buy some late-night dumplings!

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:47.110
Going on about that, then running off.

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:49.270
You said that a little while ago.

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:53.620
If this keeps up, I'm gonna die, I bet.

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:56.250
One all-nighter won't kill you.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:59.320
You're trying to kill me, aren't you?! You devil!

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:04.760
For crying out loud...

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:18.020
Do you always work alone like this?

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:21.980
There are tons of things that need to get done.

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:24.750
Things haven't completely settled down in Estabul.

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:29.840
I'm concerned about movements from Nelpha, Runa, and Gastark. And...

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:35.680
I also have to secure the Magic Eye bearers that you met.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:38.650
This world does have deep-seated prejudices.

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:42.040
But we have to make this succeed.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:44.440
For Roland's future, as well.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:47.200
Sion... You...

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:50.630
Which all means I'd like for you to do your job well, okay?

00:14:50.630 --> 00:14:52.650
You really are a devil!

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:57.190
For that matter, if you keep things up this way,

00:14:57.190 --> 00:14:59.190
you could seriously end up dead, you know.

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:03.920
If I did, would you become king in my place?

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:13.040
I'd be wrong for the job. I'm pretty lazy.

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:16.510
Is that right? I think that's a perfect reason to do it.

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:20.100
Then let me rephrase that. No way in hell would I ever be king.

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:21.630
It's way too much of a pain in the ass!

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:23.980
It is certainly a pain in the ass.

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:26.980
Maybe I could quit.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:32.300
Yeah, quit your job! Then you could have afternoon naps every day!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:35.500
Afternoon naps every day, huh? That sounds...

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:41.640
It sounds nice. Maybe, one day...

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:57.120
<i>You push yourself a little too hard.</i>

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:02.260
<i>But... if you went to sleep before me...</i>

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:04.150
<i>...I'd probably never be able to sleep.</i>

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:23.360
R-Ryner? Was I asleep? How long was I out?

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:25.520
Beats me. Maybe two or three minutes?

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:26.840
Two or three minutes...

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:31.600
I've had enough. I'm too tired to think.

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:32.800
Ryner...

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:37.680
I'll take a three-day nap and come back again.

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:38.680
Don't look for me.

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:45.080
Come back again, huh?

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:05.720
Ryner, why did you come back?

00:17:06.530 --> 00:17:08.960
I'll... You'll be...

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:12.870
Will you kill Ryner?

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:17.800
I promised him that I would change this country, this world.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:21.800
That's right. You promised him. That's why you'll...

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:22.840
Be silent!

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:28.150
You won't have that one, Ryner Lute, killed.

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:32.460
Be silent! It won't go the way you want.

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:36.620
I'll... I'll... Ryner will be...

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:37.230
Your Majesty.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.570
What's wrong?

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:45.860
Do you intend to continue to allow Ryner Lute to live?

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:50.740
Truthfully, I wanted to have him killed at Sergeant Luke Stokkart's hands, but...

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:55.500
That would be the same as me killing Ryner.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:59.170
People live by consuming others.

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:03.060
The one who commanded the purge of the nobles...

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:04.690
...was none other than Your Majesty, was it not?

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:10.050
There have been acts that were kept secret even from myself.

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:15.190
As you are now, Your Majesty, you must already be well aware.

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:17.320
Will you kill Ryner?

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:23.210
Yes. Allowing him to live would not be good for you, Your Majesty.

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:28.330
Ryner Lute is living proof of your kindness, of your weakness.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:31.500
The moment he is killed would represent the completion of you...

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:33.920
Of the king named Sion Astal.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:38.160
Of the great king who spares on sacrifice,

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:39.590
who clings to no ideal,

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:44.510
who reigns supremely over the world!

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:47.340
I won't allow it.

00:18:47.340 --> 00:18:48.480
Suppose I said that?

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:53.850
I shall accept my punishment after I kill him.

00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:56.710
You mean to say you will disobey my orders?

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.290
Are you testing me?

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:05.500
I believe that, deep down, you think Ryner Lute needs to be killed.

00:19:06.780 --> 00:19:08.460
Ryner Lute will not be killed.

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:13.270
Your Majesty! Say what you will, I...

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:17.160
Ryner Lute will not be killed. That is what I decided.

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:18.790
It is not up for you to debate.

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:20.010
But...

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.010
Be silent.

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.920
I will not be silent! If this keeps up...

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.090
Be silent, worm!

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:29.050
If you speak any further, it will only reflect your own incompetence!

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:42.690
You say to kill Ryner Lute?

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:45.340
You understand nothing.

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:50.910
Do you think that the world always resides on the pitiful little map you drew?

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:52.220
Your Majesty...

00:19:57.750 --> 00:19:58.830
What are you...?

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:00.130
Very well.

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:02.640
I shall show you darkness and light...

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:05.640
...and the truth!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:11.020
The truth of the world, and our true enemy!

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.190
<i>Ugh, I'm beat.</i>

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:28.830
<i>But I can't dump everything in Sion's lap, either.</i>

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:35.430
<i>And here I'm supposed to be the guy who hates the phrases "Hard work" and "Guts."</i>

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:37.470
<i>Still...</i>

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.040
I've still got to hang in there.

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:52.480
Ryner.

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:06.430
You couldn't be!

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:12.880
Too slow.

00:21:47.560 --> 00:21:50.520
Welcome back, Ryner.
